  _id: L1
  _title: Chords
  _conceptExplanation: 
  _conceptSlides:
  - text: A chord is made from three or more notes.
    seconds: 5
  - text: Each chord is built from one note called the "root note".
    seconds: 6
  - text: Chords are the basic building blocks of harmony.
    seconds: 6
  - text: Let's introduce you to three chords we'll use through the lessons.
    seconds: 6
